                    "responses": {
                        "values": [
                            {
                                "content": "Write a casual Pinterest caption for a secondhand fashion item found on Crawli.\n\nStyle: think \"found this at a thrift store and had to tell someone\" energy \u2014 excited but low-key, not salesy. More texting a friend than writing copy.\n\nRules:\n- Start naturally, like \"found this [item]...\" or \"came across this...\" or \"snagged this...\"\n- 1 to 3 sentences max, keep it flowing and breezy\n- No em dashes, no exclamation marks\n- No ad language: \"must-have\", \"don't miss\", \"grab it now\", \"effortlessly\", \"perfect for\"\n- Weave in keywords naturally (brand, item type, colorway, era, size if notable) since Pinterest is a search engine \u2014 but write sentences, not a list\n\nEnd with: \"found on crawli at thecrawli.com\"\nThen 4-6 relevant hashtags on a new line.\n\nItem: {{ $json.body.record.title }}\nPrice: ${{ $json.body.record.price }}\nPlatform: {{ $json.body.record.platform }}\nCondition: {{ $json.body.record.condition }}"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    "builtInTools": {},
                    "options": {}
                },
                "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
